The fixtures of the knayi command's tests (test/next/cli/). All are hand-written for these tests, from common
Burmese words and their Zawgyi spellings; none comes from a corpus or another project (CONTRIBUTING.md, "Licences,
fonts and test data").

mixed.txt         a Unicode line, a Zawgyi line, a line whose evidence ties, and a line with no Myanmar letter
issues.txt        one line for each kind of issue check reports, a clean line, a Zawgyi line, an issue after an emoji
records.jsonl     JSON Lines: a 20-digit id, nested values, a blank line, 1.50, text escaped as Python writes it
win.txt           Win Innwa text typed in ASCII
win-1252.txt      Win Innwa text saved in Windows-1252: the bytes 61 D3 0A, which are not UTF-8
invalid-utf8.txt  the bytes of "ok", "a" with 0xFF, and "ok", one per line: line 2 is not UTF-8
